# API Documentation

## Authentication

### Register User
**POST** `/api/auth/register`

Creates a new user account.

### User Login
**POST** `/api/auth/login`

Authenticates a registered user.

## Food Freshness Predictions

### Create Prediction
**POST** `/api/predictions`

Uploads/records a food freshness prediction.

### Get All Predictions
**GET** `/api/predictions`

Retrieves prediction records.

### Get Prediction by ID
**GET** `/api/predictions/:id`

Retrieves one prediction by its ID.

### Delete Prediction
**DELETE** `/api/predictions/:id`

Deletes a prediction record.
